      "summary": "The ACR endpoint assertion addresses the previous finding. The output secret check still has a reachable bypass through a local reference.",
      "findingList": [
        {
          "severity": "major",
          "file": "infra/terraform/tests/release-identity.tftest.hcl",
          "line": 423,
          "message": "The output check can miss credential-bearing values routed through Terraform locals. Resolve output expressions or otherwise ensure an output backed by a local containing a storage key fails AC RELEASE-ID-04.",
          "confidence": 0.92,
          "category": "testing",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The new source check scans output blocks for credential-related text, but does not resolve local references. The evaluated-value check searches for recognizable text, which an opaque key may not contain.",
            "failureScenario": "If an output is changed to reference a local whose value is azurerm_storage_account.demo.primary_access_key, the output block contains only the local reference and the evaluated key may match none of the text patterns. The test can pass while exposing storage-key material, so AC RELEASE-ID-04 remains unenforced."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
